ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Las mañanas lluviosas son
muy refrescantes, ¿no crees,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ah, la pioggia mattutina! Un modo
sublime per iniziare la giornata,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
n'est-ce pas, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}I wonder how long it's going to keep
raining.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Maybe it'll stop by tonight,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Je me demande quand la pluie va
cesser...{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ce soir, peut-être,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Wie lange es wohl noch regnet?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Vielleicht hört es heute Abend auf,
{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Che bello rivederti{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}La pioggia è il segno che oggi sarà
un giorno fantastique,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Good to see you out and about!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}It would be a waste to stay inside
when it's raining out,{{TAG:0003:0026:}} {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Buenos y lluviosos días!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}¡Dan ganas de montar una fiesta
al aire libre,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}This rain does NOT want to stop!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Oh well.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} We'll just have to make
the best of it,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}No parece que vaya a parar.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}¡Pero no te deprimas, al final
siempre sale el sol,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bu yağmur durmak BİLMİYOR!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0026:}}Neyse.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Elimizdekinden keyif çıkarmaya
bakacağız,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Chouette, de nouveau toi !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}J'ai beau avoir le sang froid, la pluie
ça me réchauffe quand même,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Che bello rivederti!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} La pioggia mi
mette di buon umore come una
torta appena fatta,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

{{TAG:0003:0003:}}A volte adoooro chiudere gli occhi
e ascoltare il suono della pioggia!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}È così dooolce,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Encore dehors à cette heure ?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Tu bois trop de vitamines le matin,
toi, {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Che ci fai in giro a quest'ora?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Sprizzi energia da tutti i pori,
{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ah, le bruit de la pluie...{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0019:}}Dans le genre berceuse, on fait pas
mieux,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

{{TAG:0003:001D:}}Youpi, la pluie ! Youhou !{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Avis à la population :{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} le prochain
parapluie que je vois, {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}je l'atomise !
